  Key: Warrior
  Label: Warrior
  Blurb: 
  Description: 
  Vision:
    Fantasy: "The first sword through the door. Plain steel, plain courage: no magic, no tricks, just someone who stands in front and hits hard."
    Role: "Front line. Attack and abilities scale off Strength. Takes the hits or deals them - the grid decides which."
    SignatureMechanic: 
    Branches:
    - GridBranch: a
      Becomes: "A heavy front-liner: stacks health, Endurance and resistances, and learns to protect."
      IntendedKit: "Shield Up -> Bulwark -> Ward"
      Summon: "Cairn Golem - party replacement: a stone wall at 250% of the Warrior's health that takes every blow for three turns."
    - GridBranch: b
      Becomes: "A pure attacker: stacks Strength, Agility and Luck, and learns to hit harder and wider."
      IntendedKit: "Sunder -> Cleave -> War Cry"
      Summon: "Bloodfang Boar - special attack: every hero gains +50% of their own Strength for 3 turns."
    Overlaps: "Paladin also reaches a front-liner (branch A) and a damage dealer (branch B)."
    OpenQuestions: "No signature mechanic yet - everything he has, the Paladin can also have. Blurb is empty."
  RecruitCost: 0
